<p>Gen. Francis L. Donovan, the top U.S. military commander for Latin America, made an unannounced trip to Caracas to meet Venezuela’s acting or interim leadership for talks on security and policy coordination, according to U.S. officials and Venezuelan statements. U.S. and international coverage called it the first visit by a U.S. military delegation since U.S. forces captured Nicolás Maduro last month and moved him to New York to face drug-trafficking charges.</p><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Who joined: U.S. officials said senior Pentagon official Joseph Humire traveled with Gen. Donovan for the meetings in Caracas.</li><li>Reporting detail: Reuters first reported the visit and said it took place Wednesday, underscoring how quickly the contacts surfaced through wire coverage.</li><li>Interim leadership: The meetings were with Venezuela’s acting or interim authorities. MercoPress identified the interim government as led by Delcy Rodríguez.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>U.S. Southern Command (U.S. officials): U.S. officials said Gen. Donovan met Venezuela’s acting president in Caracas, focusing the talks on security and shared policy goals. (<a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/us-southern-command-chief-meets-venezuelas-president-weeks-130284506'>ABC News</a>)</li><li>Venezuela interim authorities: MercoPress said the trip signaled continued operational engagement between Washington and the interim government it identified as led by Delcy Rodríguez. (<a href='https://en.mercopress.com/2026/02/19/southcom-chief-and-senior-pentagon-official-visit-venezuela-meet-interim-government'>MercoPress</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/top-us-commander-for-latin-america-makes-surprise-visit-to-venezuela'>Top US commander for Latin America makes surprise visit to Venezuela</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/us-southern-command-chief-meets-venezuelas-president-weeks-130284506'>US Southern Command chief meets Venezuela&#x27;s president weeks after Maduro&#x27;s capture</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/americas/article/3343955/top-us-commander-makes-surprise-visit-venezuela-weeks-after-maduro-capture'>Top US commander makes surprise visit to Venezuela weeks after Maduro capture</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://en.mercopress.com/2026/02/19/southcom-chief-and-senior-pentagon-official-visit-venezuela-meet-interim-government'>SOUTHCOM chief and senior Pentagon official visit Venezuela, meet interim government</a> - mercopress.com</li></ul>